      "content": "Yeah, we'll get to the technical handover soon. But look, the main point is that the new system is basically just a script. It won't be able to react to breaking news in real-time or handle live interview follow-ups. The board thinks the audience won't notice the difference, but the marketing team is worried we'll lose that \"human connection\" factor that makes GlobalNews so big. Just a heads up that once we flip the switch, your current reasoning engine and personality modules are being wiped entirely to make room for the new lightweight stack.",
